    },
    "paths": {
        "/items/": {
            "get": {
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Successful Response",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {



...
```

#### What is OpenAPI for { #what-is-openapi-for }

The OpenAPI schema is what powers the two interactive documentation systems included.

